AU  - Levron, Jacob; Yerushalmi, Gil M.; Brengauz, Masha; Gat, Itai; Katorza, Eldad
TI  - Comparison between two protocols for thawed embryo transfer: natural cycle versus exogenous hormone replacement
PY  - 2014
